# =========================================================================
# Repository scope: ONLY the SQ5 Voice App (web/ + voicestudio/ + DB).
# Everything else in the working directory is local-only and excluded.
# =========================================================================

# --- Top-level allowlist via explicit ignore of everything we don't want -
# Start by excluding all files at the root, then re-include the few that
# really belong.  This is the safest approach since the working directory
# is a messy local workspace.

# Game / GOG installer cruft
*.exe
*.dat
*.ico
*.bmp
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.tif
*.pdf
*.htm
*.html
